"paste into ChatGPT / Claude / Gemini after your problem description. Each prompt embeds the "
"relevant diagnostic outputs already collected from this machine and asks the chatbot to reply in "
"%(lang)s. Sensitive data (MAC, IP, UUID, serial, hostname) is redacted."
